WEBVTT

1
00:00:07,570 --> 00:00:09,770
What are you doing when he is so old?

2
00:00:09,930 --> 00:00:11,530
How could you attack an old man?

3
00:00:12,210 --> 00:00:13,610
I still ignore money in front of you.

4
00:00:13,730 --> 00:00:14,890
Still using it as I like

5
00:00:15,290 --> 00:00:17,090
Who has the final say now is who has the toughest fist?

6
00:00:17,530 --> 00:00:19,370
I'll clean up you bunch of rubbish today

7
00:00:20,330 --> 00:00:22,010
You guys are just a bunch of beasts

8
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:26,500
You dare to call us beasts

9
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:31,290
Today I will show you what the beast is looking for to stop it.
